L000334	    P^k_\mathrm{c,L}=\frac{2k^2}{(M+1)^2}T_k^2+\frac{(M+1-k)^2T_\mathrm{S}^2+k^2T_\mathrm{D}^2}{(M+1)^2}+2\frac{(M+1-k)^2\sum_{j=1}^{k-1}T_j^2+k^2\sum_{j=k+1}^MT_j^2}{(M+1)^2},
